\par\par \b \uc2 BOJ Noda: To Provide Adequate Funds, Making Use Of  \highlight22\uc2 FX Intervention \highlight\uc2  Funds\b0\par\par\uc2 154 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2010\par 08:01\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - - \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - - \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - - \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - - \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SHIMONOSEKI, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will make use of yen sold in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , policy board member Tadao Noda said Wednesday, indicating that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may not soak up the extra \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from the market.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Allowing the funds to slosh around in the market--leaving the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  'unsterilized', in market parlance--sharpens the effect of the MOF's yen-weakening action, analysts say.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Funds that entered the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market through Wednesday's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  "have a temporary ability to provide money to the financial market," Noda told reporters after meeting business leaders in Shimonoseki, southern Japan.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "For now, I think we are going to supply ample funds, making use of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  funds," he added.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Tomoyuki Tachikawa, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-6269-2787; tomoyuki.tachikawa@dowjones.com [ 15-09-10 0637GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100915e69f000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
