\par\par \b \uc2 HIGHLIGHTS 2-BOJ Noda: not linking policy to  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 380 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2010\par 08:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (For more stories on the Japanese economy, click [ID:nECONJP])\par \par \uc2 SHIMONOSEKI, Japan, Sept 15 (Reuters) - Bank of Japan policy board member Tadao Noda indicated on Wednesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may leave \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  unsterilised but added that it would not link its policy actions directly to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 He also said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will take speedy, bold policy action if the economy's outlook deteriorates considerably.\par \par \uc2 Following are key quotes from Noda, a banking industry veteran, in a speech delivered to business leaders and at a news conference in Shimonoseki, in southern \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 (From news conference)\par \par \uc2 "I personally think the BOJ will supply ample funds while it eyes making use of funds from \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But I do not think the volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds will directly cause an increase in reserves parked at the BOJ...\par \par \uc2 "I do not intend to discuss whether \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be sterilised or unsterilised. We will decide whether the fund supply is ample or not based on the level of funds supplied."\par \par \uc2 POLICY\par \par \uc2 (From news conference)\par \par \uc2 "I am keeping in mind a series of policy options including expansion of steps taken so far...\par \par \uc2 "We will pursue policy responses depending on moves in the economy and in prices but the BOJ will not consider policy in a manner that links directly to the latest (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) step."\par \par \uc2 (From speech)\par \par \uc2 "If the economic outlook deteriorates considerably and uncertainty arises over Japan's escape from deflation, we will need to act quickly and boldly....\par \par \uc2 "We need to keep in mind that effects and drawbacks of each policy option will appear in different forms depending on changes in the fiscal situation."\par \par \uc2 YEN\par \par \uc2 (From news conference)\par \par \uc2 "I strongly hope \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will stabilise the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market."\par \par \uc2 (From speech)\par \par \uc2 "The pace of export growth is likely to be moderate in the near term as overseas inventory restocking has run its course, growth in emerging economies is moderating, and due to the yen's recent uptrend."\par \par \uc2 ECONOMY\par \par \uc2 "There is no clear sign yet of a sustained recovery in domestic demand." (Reporting by Rie Ishiguro; Editing by Edmund Klamann)\par \par \uc2 JAPAN-ECONOMY/BOJ-NODA (HIGHLIGHTS 2)|LANGEN|J|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|U|NAT|RNP|DNP|PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100915e69f0004k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
