uminum down $7 at $2153. Gold futures pulled back as participants cashed in on its record highs recently; December Comex gold down $3 to $1,268.70/oz. (colin.ng@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in Singapore. 65 64154 140; \par MarketTalk@dowjones.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 09-15-10 1818ET ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1012 1079 1085 4041 75025 75112 8764   \par \par \uc2 Dokument NRG0000020100915e69f0005d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
