\par\par \b \uc2 Light gains for Taiwan dlr after yen  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 422 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2010\par 04:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited    \par \par \uc2  * T$ recovers from local c.bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday\par \par \uc2  * U.S. dollar gains broadly as \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in yen prices\par \par \uc2  * Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  seen gaining in the long term  (Updates to close)\par \par \uc2  TAIPEI, Sept 15 (Reuters) - The Taiwan dollar <TWD=TP> rose modestly on Wednesday, recovering from a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  move in the previous session, but fell steeply from early trade to its close as the U.S. dollar gained after \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the yen.\par \par \uc2  The Taiwan dollar ended at T$31.798 to the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  compared with Tuesday's close of T$31.815 after the latter bounced back from early-session lows against the yen on the first Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in six years [ID:nTOE68E050].\par \par \uc2  The growth-linked Taiwan dollar is seen strengthening in the long term after the U.S. dollar-yen issue cools down. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would firm then on recent upbeat economic data in major world markets and a solid outlook for Asia.\par \par \uc2  "When the dust settles, and it will, the fundamentals in general of Asian economies remain strong," said Patrick Bennett, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist with Standard Bank in Hong Kong. "The medium-term trend for Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains toward strength."\par \par \uc2  LONG-TERM FACTORS\par \par \uc2  -- Upbeat economic data or earnings from the United States, Taiwan's No.2 export market, would support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as investors favour growth-linked assets. Signs of weakness in the U.S. economy could pressure the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2  -- Taiwan's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will track gains in the yuan as a proxy for the non-convertible Chinese unit because of the island's strong trade ties with China.\par \par \uc2  -- A resurfacing of the euro zone sovereign debt crisis could spread into global financial markets and weaken growth-linked \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  such as the Taiwan dollar.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                       0800 GMT         PREVIOUS SESSION CLOSE\par T$ (\f28 \uc2 \f2 Taipei \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 )      31.798                 31.815\par  T$ (Cosmos1)           31.770                 31.721\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 Taipei \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2  is Taiwan's main \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  exchange; Cosmos is a\par small exchange.\par NDFs (vs U.S. dollar)\par                0821 GMT             PREVIOUS SESSION, 0805 GMT\par 6-month           T$31.490                         T$31.440\par 2-year            T$30.825                         T$30.815\par Net foreign trading in Taiwan stocks (T$ bln)\par      Wednesday              Month to date               August\par         3.890                   41.186                 -46.222\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  See [EMRG/FRX] for a table of year-to-date Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par performance.\par  (Reporting by Ralph Jennings; Editing by Jacqueline Wong)\par \par \par \par \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 -TAIWAN/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|Z|RNP|DNP|PTD|PM