\par\par \b \uc2 JGBs rally, take  \highlight22\uc2 Japan FX intervention \highlight\uc2  in stride\b0\par\par\uc2 472 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2010\par 03:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Twenty-year JGB yield drops as much as 14 bps\par \par \uc2 * Investors had been awaiting outcome of DPJ race -analyst\par \par \uc2 * Doubts about \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  impact seen supporting JGBs\par \par \uc2 * BOJ ready to leave \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  unsterilised -sources\par \par \uc2 By Masayuki Kitano\par \par \uc2 TOKYO, Sept 15 (Reuters) - Japanese government bonds rallied broadly on Wednesday, as Prime Minister Naoto Kan's win in a ruling party leadership vote the previous day soothed worries that the government might lean towards a more expansionary fiscal policy.\par \par \uc2 JGBs took in stride news that Japanese authorities had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to sell yen for the first time in six years, in a move \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders said would only slow the yen's persistent rise.\par \par \uc2 "Market players seem to be taking the view that this is unlikely to lead to a trend of yen weakness," said Kazuhiko Sano, a fixed-income strategist at \uc2 Tokai Tokyo Securities\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The benchmark 10-year JGB yield could re-test a seven-year low of 0.895 percent hit in late August by the year's end, he added.\par \par \uc2 A sustained drop in the yen could dent JGBs, as a weaker yen could give a boost to Japanese exporters and the stock market.\par \par \uc2 Sources familiar with the matter said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  was ready to leave the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  unsterilised -- holding off draining the funds that went into the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market through the yen selling.\par \par \uc2 Shinsuke Kanabu, joint general manager at money broker \uc2 Central Tanshi\uc2 's management planing division, said such a measure was unlikely to have much impact on yen short-term interest rates, which are already very low.\par \par \uc2 "There might be an announcement effect, and it may also be a way of showing that the Bank of Japan has cooperated with the government," Kanabu said.\par \par \uc2 Bank of Japan policy board member Tadao Noda indicated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may leave \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  unsterilised but added that it would not link its policy actions directly to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ..\par \par \uc2 After trimming some gains, the 20-year yield stood at 1.755 percent, well off a three-month high of 1.975 percent hit on Tuesday ahead of an auction in that maturity and the ruling party vote.\par \par \uc2 Lead December 10-year Japanese government bond futures surged 0.74 point to 142.12 and the benchmark 10-year JGB yield fell 9 basis points to 1.040 percent.\par \par \uc2 Fukunaga at RBS Securities said the 20-year JGB yield would probably move between 1.975 percent and 1.510 percent, a trough hit in late August, for the rest of the year.\par \par \uc2 If the 20-year yield approaches the August low, that would probably re-ignite worries that JGBs may have rallied too far, Fukunaga said. (Editing by Chris Gallagher)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-JAPAN-JGB (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABX|BNX|FUN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100918e69f0000o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
