\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF Will  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In Tokyo Thursday If Needed - Sources\b0\par\par\uc2 625 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2010\par 17:26\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  authorities \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the New York \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday in an effort to curb the yen's strength, people familiar with the Japanese government's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy told Dow Jones Newswires.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which sets \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, will continue its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  campaign in Tokyo on Thursday if deemed necessary, those people said on conditions of anonymity.\par \par \uc2 -By Takashi Nakamichi; Dow Jones Newswires; takashi.nakamichi@dowjones.com [ 15-09-10 1545GMT ]\par \par \uc2 (Updates with comments from \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategists starting in second paragraph)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Bradley Davis and Takashi Nakamichi \par    Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--After \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's massive \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  during Asian and European trading hours to push the yen down from a 15-year high against the dollar, people familiar with the Japanese government's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy said \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  continued to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets in North American trading.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Though the yen continues to stay at levels Japanese officials are targeting, New York-based traders said there was scant concrete evidence Japan was actively participating in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets during New York hours. The dollar remained significantly stronger against the yen but hasn't spiked higher--a key indicator of direct \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 --during North American trading.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "They could be \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  via stealth" measures, but "we're not seeing anything on the charts," or in the bank's own flows, during North American trading, said Amelia Bourdeau, senior G10 \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist at \f28 \uc2 \f2 UBS\f28 \uc2 \f2  in Stamford, Conn.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A number of leading \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  institutions in New York said there had been no clear indications of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in North American trading.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The reports of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  "could be a verbal \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , and I view verbal \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as early rungs of the ladder of a full \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," said Marc Chandler, global head of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at \f28 \uc2 \f2 Brown Brothers Harriman\f28 \uc2 \f2  in New York, who said he had seen no evidence of direct \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Hidetoshi Yanagihara, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist at the New York offices of Japan's \f28 \uc2 \f2 Mizuho Corporate Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2 , said that the assumption was that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  during North American trading, but that his bank's traders also didn't see evidence of this.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which sets \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy, is likely to continue \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  during New York hours, said Steven Englander, head of G10 strategy at \f28 \uc2 \f2 Citigroup\f28 \uc2 \f2  in New York. However, Tom Fitzpatrick, Citi's chief technical analyst in New York, said the bank's traders had yet to see any evidence of further \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The dollar was sharply higher against the yen midday in New York but hadn't extended its gains dramatically during North American trading. It was recently at Y85.62 from Y83.08 late Tuesday, according to EBS via CQG.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Though there was no concrete evidence \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  continued to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  during New York trading, \f28 \uc2 \f2 UBS\f28 \uc2 \f2 's Bourdeau said the MOF probably would have to continue dipping into the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to keep the yen suppressed. Investors still want to flock to the perceived safety of the yen as concern mounts over a U.S. economic slowdown and whether the Federal Reserve will announce another round of asset purchases to kickstart the U.S. economy.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 If Japan is trying to set a floor between Y80 and Y85, "they're going to have to back it up" with more \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Bourdeau said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will continue its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  campaign in Tokyo on Thursday if deemed necessary, people familiar with the government's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy told Dow Jones Newswires on conditions of anonymity.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Bradley Davis, Dow Jones Newswires; 212-416-2654;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 bradley.davis@dowjones.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (Andrew J. Johnson in New York contributed to this article.) [ 15-09-10 1645GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100915e69f0017q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
