\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  Govt Official: Won't Rule Out  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\uc2  Again In Europe  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkts\b0\par\par\uc2 140 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2010\par 14:12\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - - \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - - \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - - \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  won't rule out \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market, and it will take action in the U.S. market as well if needed, a Japanese government official said Wednesday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We aren't necessarily acting only in the Tokyo market," he said. The Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  "isn't ruling out" \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  again in the European market and "will (\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ) in the U.S. market if necessary," he said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 He added that while the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  so far "seemed to have quite an impact" on the markets, "we can't easily declare we've succeeded" given the uncertainty over how it will play out.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Takashi Nakamichi, Dow Jones Newswires; +81-3-6269-2781; takashi.nakamichi@dowjones.com [ 15-09-10 1235GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100915e69f0010c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
