\par\par \b \uc2 News Highlights: Top Economic Stories Of The Day\b0\par\par\uc2 669 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2010\par 14:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par TOP STORIES \par  \par US MORTGAGE-REFINANCE ACTIVITY SLUMPS \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The volume of mortgage applications filed in the U.S. last week drops 8.9% from the previous week, the Mortgage Bankers Association reports, on declines in refinancing activity.\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 JAPAN\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  SPLASHES Y1 TRILLION TO COOL YEN \par  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan intervenes\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market for the first time in more than six years, launching a wave of yen selling totaling an estimated Y1 trillion to counter what it calls "the severe economic conditions' facing the country.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par YUAN HITS FRESH HIGH ON RECORD-LOW FIXING \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's yuan rose to a high against the U.S. dollar for the fourth consecutive trading session, after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  set the dollar-yuan central parity at a record low and the dollar slumped in international markets overnight.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par EURO-ZONE INFLATION SLIPS FURTHER BELOW ECB TARGET \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The euro zone's annual inflation rate dips in line with expectations in August, indicating the European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has room to maintain its ultra-loose monetary policy, data from the EU's Eurostat statistics agency shows.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par BEAZER MAY MISS 4Q ORDERS VIEW \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Home builder says it might miss order expectations for its about-to-end fiscal fourth quarter as it cut estimates for the year on land and development spending hurt by the expiration of a federal home-buyer tax credit.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par US STOCK FUTURES LOWER AHEAD OF ECONOMIC DATA \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.S. stock-market futures edged lower ahead of data on import prices and industrial production, while the dollar rebounded against the yen after \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par UK JOBLESS CLAIMANT FIGURES RISE UNEXPECTEDLY \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.K. claimant count unemployment rises in August by 2,300, for the first time since January this year, giving a jobless rate of 4.5% and hinting at tough times ahead once government spending cuts begin to bite in earnest.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par IWH UPS GERMAN GDP FORECAST TO 3.5% FOR 2010 \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The German economy will grow much more strongly this year than previously expected at 3.5%, but the pace of expansion will slow in 2011 as the global economic slowdown dents German exports, IWH says.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par ANGLOGOLD ASHANTI TO RAISE $1.4B CAPITAL \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Anglogold Ashanti is issuing new equity and mandatory convertibles amounting to no less than $1.37 billion in an effort to unwind its gold hedge and gain full exposure to record high gold prices.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par AXA COMPLETES EUR1.7B SALE OF UK ASSETS TO RESOLUTION \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 French insurer AXA says it has completed the sale to Resolution of its UK-based traditional life and pensions businesses, its IFA protection and corporate pension businesses, and its annuity businesses.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par  \par  \par    ======== DOW JONES NEWSWIRES ANALYSIS AND COMMENTARY ======== \par  \par  \par Focus \par SWEDEN'S REINFELDT IN ECONOMIC BOOST AS VOTE NEARS \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Swedish Prime Minister Fredrik Reinfeldt heads into Sunday's general election on the crest of the sharpest economic recovery among Europe's major countries.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Money Talks \par TURNING JAPANESE? I REALLY DON'T THINK SO.... \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Ever since the financial crisis struck, a significant group of Keynesian economists has warned that the U.S. and other leading economies run the risk of turning Japanese.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Heard on the Street \par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 INTERVENTION\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  NEEDS TO BE BIG IN \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 JAPAN\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 Is Tokyo going to take a firehose to a fight with a tsunami, asks James Simms, after the Japanese government ended a six-year moratorium on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets, selling the yen in an effort to reverse its recent rise.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par   ============ MARKETS ACTION ============ \par  \par US STOCK FUTURES LOWER AHEAD OF ECONOMIC DATA \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Stock futures lower ahead of economic data.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par TREASURYS LOWER AFTER \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 JAPAN INTERVENTION\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 US Treasurys drop as \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  gives risk sentiment a boost.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par EUR/GBP UNDER PRESSURE AS GBP/USD RISES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The EUR/GBP is under pressure as the GBP/USD rises.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par CRUDE LOWER AS PRESSURE BUILDS AHEAD OF DOE DATA \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Crude trades lower ahead of key U.S. DOE data.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par SPOT GOLD PAUSES, RALLY TO $1,300/OZ SEEN \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Spot gold consolidates gains after rallying to new record highs. [ 15-09-10 1200GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1030 1804 4180   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100915e69f000zm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
