\par\par \b \uc2 Singapore MAS Waiting To See Impact Of  \highlight22\uc2 Japan Intervention \highlight\uc2  On US Dollar - Source\b0\par\par\uc2 220 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2010\par 07:20\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore is gauging the impact of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which should help other Asian authorities cope with their strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a person familiar with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's thinking said Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The MAS may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again if the U.S. dollar should fall back to around S$1.3300 from current levels around S$1.3370, but for now it is watching the market, the person told Dow Jones Newswires.\par \par \uc2 Japan's Finance Ministry, operating through the Bank of Japan, sold yen aggressively from Wednesday morning for the first time since March 2004, driving the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sharply higher against the yen from 15-year lows.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also rose against the Singapore dollar and other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , taking some heat off the authorities, who fear their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' strength could hurt their export-reliant recoveries.\par \par \uc2 "The BOJ move makes it easier for other Asia central banks to manage the (U.S.) dollar's fall," the person said, reflecting the broadly held view that Asia can't change the weak-dollar trend but wants to keep moves under control.\par \par \uc2 -By Singapore Bureau; +65 64154 150; djnews.singapore.bureau@dowjones.com [ 15-09-10 0532GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100915e69f000by\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
